TITLE Mix DIC and Ca solutions 1:1, heat 20 to 200 C, calcite equil
SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 50 mmol/kgw
SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50 mmol/kgw
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -temperature true
    -pH true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Temp pH
    10 PUNCH TC, -LA("H+")
END
